performance metric and period, fitted using the mixed model described in
the statistical model formulation section. Letters indicate
Dunnett-adjusted significant differences versus the F18-ETEC (PC)
group; rows highlighted in red reached significance (P < 0.05) and rows
highlighted in yellow indicate a tendency (P < 0.10). The SEM column
gives the standard error from the mixed model, and p-values for the
treatment factor and the start weight covariate are also shown. The
dataset used here had outliers removed prior to model fitting.

